  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PDF PUM 2015 Prog. &amp; Methods Dev. - Technical Assistance IOD</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PDF PUM 2015 Program- &amp; metodutvecklingsfond</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

Ambassaden har sedan 2004 haft en &#xe5;rlig program- och metodutvecklingsinsats, med syfte att st&#xe4;rka beredning, uppf&#xf6;ljning och utv&#xe4;rdering av insatser och d&#xe4;rigenom bidra till &#xf6;kad kompetens inom utvecklingssamarbetet med Mocambique.

Ett antal f&#xf6;rberedande och st&#xf6;djande enskilda uppdrag finansieras ur fonden, exempelvis bakgrundsstudier inf&#xf6;r en ny beredning, av en ny partner, ett nytt omr&#xe5;de eller en ny metod. Uppdragen kan ocks&#xe5; ber&#xf6;ra utv&#xe4;rderingar eller uppf&#xf6;ljningsrelaterade studier, revisioner eller granskningar n&#xe4;r s&#xe5;dana inte budgeterats f&#xf6;r i den specifika insatsen.

Uppdragen ska vara relevanta f&#xf6;r strategim&#xe5;l eller motsvarande samt vara f&#xf6;renliga med av regeringen beslutade styrande dokument f&#xf6;r bist&#xe5;ndet och Sidas verksamhetsplan.

Varje enskild komponent b&#xf6;r inte &#xf6;verskrida en tidsram p&#xe5; sex m&#xe5;nader och ska vara begr&#xe4;nsad i sin utformning, samt vara kopplad till tydliga resultat.

Varje uppdrag skall;
(i) beslutas om i ett separat beslut
(ii) handl&#xe4;ggas av ansvarig handl&#xe4;ggare, b&#xe5;de g&#xe4;llande draft av beslut/kontrakt/ToR osv, finansiella transaktioner och resultatuppf&#xf6;ljning</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The embassy has since 2004 had an annual contribution for program- and method development, with the aim of strengthening the preparation, monitoring and evaluation of interventions and thereby contribute to increased competence in development cooperation with Mozambique.

A number of preparatory and supportive individual assignments are financed from the fund, such as background studies of a new partner, of a new area or of a new method. Assignments such as evaluations or follow-up related studies, audits or reviews can also be financed from the fund.

The assignments shall be relevant to the objectives in the strategy or equivalent and be consistent with the governing documents for aid decided by the Government as well as with Sida&apos;s operational plan.

The assignments/components should not exceed a period of six months and shall be limited in their design, as well as being linked to clear results.

Each assignment will;
 (i) be determined in a separate decision
 (ii) have a separate component in this contribution (PUM)
 (iii) be dealt with by the officer in charge, both regarding the draft Decision / contract / ToR, etc., the financial transactions and the performance monitoring</narrative>
  </description>
